{"v":[[1,"And the word of the Lord came unto me, saying,"],[2,"Son of man, What is the vine tree more than any tree, or than a branch which is among the trees of the forest?"],[3,"Shall wood be taken thereof to do any work? or will men take a pin of it to hang any vessel thereon?"],[4,"Behold, it is cast into the fire for fuel; the fire devoureth both the ends of it, and the midst of it is burned. Is it meet for any work?"],[5,"Behold, when it was whole, it was meet for no work: how much less shall it be meet yet for any work, when the fire hath devoured it, and it is burned?"],[6,"Therefore thus saith the Lord God; As the vine tree among the trees of the forest, which I have given to the fire for fuel, so will I give the inhabitants of Jerusalem."],[7,"And I will set my face against them; they shall go out from one fire, and another fire shall devour them; and ye shall know that I am the Lord, when I set my face against them."],[8,"And I will make the land desolate, because they have committed a trespass, saith the Lord God."]],"w":{"1":[["va-yhi","and it came","H1961"],["devar","[the] word of","H1697"],["yahweh","Yahweh","H3068"],["'ela-i","to me","H413"],["le-mor","<to> saying","H559"]],"2":[["ben","O son of","H1121"],["'adam","humankind","H120"],["mah","what?","H4100"],["yihyeh","is it","H1961"],["'etz","[the] wood of","H6086"],["ha-gefen","the vine","H1612"],["mi-kol","more than any","H3605"],["'etz","tree","H6086"],["ha-zemorah","the vine branch","H2156"],["'asher","which","H834"],["hayah","it is","H1961"],["ba-'atzei","among [the] trees of","H6086"],["hai-ya'ar","the forest","H3293"]],"3":[["ha-yukach","¿ is it taken","H3947"],["mime-nu","from it","H4480"],["'etz","wood","H6086"],["la-'asot","to make","H6213"],["li-mlakhah","into a product","H4399"],["'im","or?","H518"],["yikchu","do people take","H3947"],["mime-nu","from it","H4480"],["yated","a peg","H3489"],["li-tlot","to hang","H8518"],["'ala-v","on it","H5921"],["kol","any","H3605"],["keli","vessel","H36